      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, it depends on the aosp/3530119 change, which will defer the expired service removal for some time and process them later. This causes the expired services to be retained in the cache, even though they are not visible to new listeners. However, when we process these expired services and remove them, the lost callback should only alert listeners who saw them before. Otherwise, new listeners might mistakenly run the \u0027lost\u0027 function, wasting resources.",
